That's something many people feel nervous about, but it's so important if you want

189
00:09:50,310 --> 00:09:52,190
to earn what you deserve.

190
00:09:52,190 --> 00:09:53,510
Exactly, Jack.

191
00:09:53,510 --> 00:09:57,910
