In that case, would be possible to discuss additional benefits such as flexible working

487
00:24:20,470 --> 00:24:22,830
hours or extra leave?

488
00:24:22,830 --> 00:24:25,070
That's excellent negotiation.

489
00:24:25,070 --> 00:24:26,070
Thank you.

490
00:24:26,070 --> 00:24:28,590
Now let's talk about confidence.

491
00:24:28,590 --> 00:24:30,550
This is very important.

492
00:24:30,550 --> 00:24:33,350
Many people feel nervous talking about salary.

493
00:24:33,350 --> 00:24:36,310
Yes, especially if it's their first job.

494
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:39,230
But remember, negotiation is normal.

495
00:24:39,230 --> 00:24:40,230
Companies expect it.

496
00:24:40,230 --> 00:24:42,150
That's a great mindset.

497
00:24:42,150 --> 00:24:44,790
Now let's talk about common mistakes.

498
00:24:44,790 --> 00:24:46,790
Yes, this is important.

499
00:24:46,790 --> 00:24:49,790
Mistake number one, being too direct.

500
00:24:49,790 --> 00:24:52,790
Like saying, I want more money.

501
00:24:52,790 --> 00:24:54,790
Exactly. That sounds rude.

502
00:24:54,790 --> 00:24:57,790
Instead, say, I was hoping for a higher salary.

503
00:24:57,790 --> 00:24:59,790
Much better.

504
00:24:59,790 --> 00:25:02,790
Mistake number two, not doing research.

505
00:25:02,790 --> 00:25:04,790
You need to know the market salary.

506
00:25:04,790 --> 00:25:08,790
Yes, you can say based on industry standards.

507
00:25:08,790 --> 00:25:10,790
That makes your argument stronger.

508
00:25:10,790 --> 00:25:13,790
Mistake number three, accepting too quickly.

509
00:25:13,790 --> 00:25:19,970
quickly. You should always take time to think. Yes, you can say thank you. I'd like

510
00:25:19,970 --> 00:25:25,490
some time to review the offer. That's very professional. Now let's do a longer role

