00:25:25,490 --> 00:25:31,070
play. Perfect. Congratulations. We'd like to offer you the position. Thank you very

512
00:25:31,070 --> 00:25:35,510
much. I'm really excited about this opportunity. The salary we're offering is

513
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:40,910
$55,000 per year. Thank you for the offer. I appreciate it. Based on my

514
00:25:40,910 --> 00:25:45,230
experience and the responsibilities of this role, I was expecting something

515
00:25:45,230 --> 00:25:51,910
closer to $65,000. I understand. Let me check what we can do. Thank you. I'm open

