00:39:08,310 --> 00:39:10,890
That turns the question back to the employer.

771
00:39:10,890 --> 00:39:11,890
Exactly.

772
00:39:11,890 --> 00:39:14,370
Now, let's say you receive a job offer.

773
00:39:14,370 --> 00:39:16,130
What do you say first?

774
00:39:16,130 --> 00:39:18,770
First always show appreciation.

775
00:39:18,770 --> 00:39:19,810
That's important.

776
00:39:19,810 --> 00:39:22,090
You can say, thank you for the offer.

777
00:39:22,090 --> 00:39:24,970
I'm really excited about this opportunity.

778
00:39:24,970 --> 00:39:27,290
That sounds positive and professional.

779
00:39:27,290 --> 00:39:29,330
Then you move to negotiation.

780
00:39:29,330 --> 00:39:30,330
Okay.

781
00:39:30,330 --> 00:39:31,330
How?

782
00:39:31,330 --> 00:39:34,810
You can say, I'd like to discuss the salary package.

783
00:39:34,810 --> 00:39:36,690
That's polite and direct.

784
00:39:36,690 --> 00:39:40,370
Or is there any flexibility in the salary?

785
00:39:40,370 --> 00:39:42,330
That's a very useful phrase.

786
00:39:42,330 --> 00:39:44,890
Yes, it's simple and effective.

787
00:39:44,890 --> 00:39:46,690
Let's give a full example.

788
00:39:46,690 --> 00:39:47,690
Sure.

789
00:39:47,690 --> 00:39:48,690
Thank you for the offer.

790
00:39:48,690 --> 00:39:55,150
I'm very interested in the role, however, I was hoping for a slightly higher salary.

791
00:39:55,150 --> 00:39:57,090
Is there any flexibility?

792
00:39:57,090 --> 00:39:58,090
That's very natural.

793
00:39:58,090 --> 00:40:01,070
Yes, it's polite and confident.

794
00:40:01,070 --> 00:40:03,690
What if you want to justify your request?

795
00:40:03,690 --> 00:40:04,690
Good point.

796
00:40:04,690 --> 00:40:06,850
You should always give a reason.

797
00:40:06,850 --> 00:40:07,850
For example?

798
00:40:07,850 --> 00:40:14,970
Based on my experience and skills, I was expecting a salary closer to 50,000 pounds.

799
00:40:14,970 --> 00:40:16,970
That's strong, but professional.

800
00:40:16,970 --> 00:40:17,970
Exactly.

801
00:40:17,970 --> 00:40:21,330
Now let's talk about using soft language.

802
00:40:21,330 --> 00:40:23,330
Yes, very important.

803
00:40:23,330 --> 00:40:25,890
Why is soft language important?

804
00:40:25,890 --> 00:40:30,290
Because negotiation should feel like a conversation, not a conflict.

805
00:40:30,290 --> 00:40:31,410
That's true.

806
00:40:31,410 --> 00:40:37,170
Instead of saying, I want more money, say, I was hoping for a higher salary.

807
00:40:37,170 --> 00:40:38,690
That sounds much better.

808
00:40:38,690 --> 00:40:45,170
Or instead of, this is too low, say, this is slightly below my expectations.

809
00:40:45,170 --> 00:40:46,530
Very professional.

810
00:40:46,530 --> 00:40:48,930
Now let's talk about benefits.

811
00:40:48,930 --> 00:40:51,650
Yes, salary is not the only thing.

812
00:40:51,650 --> 00:40:52,730
Exactly.

813
00:40:52,730 --> 00:40:56,210
You can also negotiate benefits, like bonuses,

814
00:40:56,210 --> 00:40:58,730
vacation, or flexible hours.

815
00:40:58,730 --> 00:41:00,290
So what can you say?

816
00:41:00,290 --> 00:41:02,170
If the salary is fixed,

817
00:41:02,170 --> 00:41:04,570
could we discuss additional benefits?

818
00:41:04,570 --> 00:41:06,410
That's a great strategy.

819
00:41:06,410 --> 00:41:10,530
Or is there any possibility of a performance bonus?

820
00:41:10,530 --> 00:41:11,910
Very useful.

821
00:41:11,910 --> 00:41:13,410
You can also say,

822
00:41:13,410 --> 00:41:16,490
could we discuss flexible working options?

823
00:41:16,490 --> 00:41:18,410
That's very common today.

824
00:41:18,410 --> 00:41:20,490
Now let's do a role play.

825
00:41:20,490 --> 00:41:21,450
Great idea.

826
00:41:21,450 --> 00:41:22,890
I'll be the candidate.

827
00:41:22,890 --> 00:41:24,450
You be the employer.

828
00:41:24,450 --> 00:41:25,290
Okay.

829
00:41:25,290 --> 00:41:26,970
We're pleased to offer you the position

830
00:41:26,970 --> 00:41:29,490
with a salary of 40,000 pounds.

831
00:41:29,490 --> 00:41:31,370
Thank you very much for the offer.

832
00:41:31,370 --> 00:41:33,890
I'm really excited about the opportunity.

833
00:41:33,890 --> 00:41:34,730
Great.

834
00:41:34,730 --> 00:41:37,490
I was hoping for a slightly higher salary

835
00:41:37,490 --> 00:41:39,370
based on my experience.

836
00:41:39,370 --> 00:41:41,170
Is there any flexibility?

837
00:41:41,170 --> 00:41:42,970
What range were you expecting?

838
00:41:42,970 --> 00:41:47,330
I was expecting something closer to 45,000 pounds.

839
00:41:47,330 --> 00:41:48,850
Let me check what we can do.

840
00:41:48,850 --> 00:41:50,810
Thank you, I appreciate that.

841
00:41:50,810 --> 00:41:52,250
That was very smooth.

842
00:41:52,250 --> 00:41:54,570
Yes, polite and professional.

843
00:41:54,570 --> 00:41:57,090
Let's do another example with benefits.

844
00:41:57,090 --> 00:41:57,850
Sure.

845
00:41:57,850 --> 00:42:02,250
The salary we can offer is 42,000 pounds and it's fixed.

846
00:42:02,250 --> 00:42:03,250
I understand.

847
00:42:03,250 --> 00:42:04,890
Thank you for explaining that.

848
00:42:04,890 --> 00:42:05,610
Yes.

849
00:42:05,610 --> 00:42:08,810
In that case, could we discuss additional benefits,

850
00:42:08,810 --> 00:42:12,170
such as a bonus or extra vacation days?

851
00:42:12,170 --> 00:42:14,210
That's a great negotiation.

852
00:42:14,210 --> 00:42:15,210
Exactly.

853
00:42:15,210 --> 00:42:17,490
Always look for alternatives.

854
00:42:17,490 --> 00:42:19,930
Now let's talk about confidence.

855
00:42:19,930 --> 00:42:21,890
Yes, this is key.

856
00:42:21,890 --> 00:42:24,690
Many people feel shy asking for more money.

857
00:42:24,690 --> 00:42:25,770
That's true.

858
00:42:25,770 --> 00:42:29,410
But remember, negotiation is normal in business.

859
00:42:29,410 --> 00:42:30,970
So it's not rude?

860
00:42:30,970 --> 00:42:32,090
Not at all.

861
00:42:32,090 --> 00:42:33,170
It's expected.

862
00:42:33,170 --> 00:42:35,050
That's important to understand.

863
00:42:35,050 --> 00:42:38,890
Yes, companies expect candidates to negotiate.

864
00:42:38,890 --> 00:42:41,290
Now let's talk about mistakes.

865
00:42:41,290 --> 00:42:42,290
Good idea.

866
00:42:42,290 --> 00:42:45,810
Mistake one, accepting the first offer immediately.

867
00:42:45,810 --> 00:42:49,210
Yes, you should at least consider negotiating.

868
00:42:49,210 --> 00:42:51,850
Mistake two, being too aggressive.

869
00:42:51,850 --> 00:42:52,850
Exactly.

870
00:42:52,850 --> 00:42:55,330
Don't say, this is unacceptable.

871
00:42:55,330 --> 00:42:57,050
Instead, be polite.

872
00:42:57,050 --> 00:42:57,870
Yes.

873
00:42:57,870 --> 00:43:00,210
Mistake three, not preparing.

874
00:43:00,210 --> 00:43:03,290
You should always research salary ranges.

875
00:43:03,290 --> 00:43:04,910
That gives you confidence.

876
00:43:04,910 --> 00:43:05,850
Exactly.

877
00:43:05,850 --> 00:43:08,170
Let's do a more detailed role play.

878
00:43:08,170 --> 00:43:11,730
Okay, tell me about your salary expectations.

879
00:43:11,730 --> 00:43:14,470
Based on my experience, I'm looking for a salary

880
00:43:14,470 --> 00:43:18,990
in the range of 45,000 pounds to 55,000 pounds.

881
00:43:18,990 --> 00:43:21,570
That's slightly above our budget.

882
00:43:21,570 --> 00:43:22,490
I understand.

883
00:43:22,490 --> 00:43:25,830
I'm open to discussion depending on the overall package.

884
00:43:25,830 --> 00:43:27,170
That's flexible.

885
00:43:27,170 --> 00:43:28,010
Yes.

886
00:43:28,010 --> 00:43:31,090
We can offer 43,000 pounds.

887
00:43:31,090 --> 00:43:32,250
Thank you for the offer.

888
00:43:32,250 --> 00:43:33,670
I really appreciate it.

889
00:43:33,670 --> 00:43:34,590
You're welcome.

890
00:43:34,590 --> 00:43:37,970
Considering my experience and the responsibilities

891
00:43:37,970 --> 00:43:45,490
the role, would it be possible to move closer to 48,000 pounds? That's a strong negotiation.

892
00:43:45,490 --> 00:43:54,450
Yes, but still polite. Let's continue. Okay, we may not reach 48,000, but we can offer 45,000.

893
00:43:54,450 --> 00:44:00,530
That sounds reasonable. Thank you for your flexibility. Deal. Great. That was very realistic.

894
00:44:00,530 --> 00:44:05,890
Yes, and very practical. Now let's talk about closing the conversation.

895
00:44:05,890 --> 00:44:08,690
Good idea. What do you say when you agree?

896
00:44:08,690 --> 00:44:09,810
You can say,

897
00:44:09,810 --> 00:44:11,090
that sounds great.

898
00:44:11,090 --> 00:44:13,250
I'm happy to accept the offer.

899
00:44:13,250 --> 00:44:14,610
Simple and clear.

900
00:44:14,610 --> 00:44:17,650
Or, I'm pleased to accept this offer.

901
00:44:17,650 --> 00:44:18,530
Thank you.

902
00:44:18,530 --> 00:44:19,890
Very professional.

903
00:44:19,890 --> 00:44:21,250
Now let's wrap up.

904
00:44:21,250 --> 00:44:25,570
Today we learned how to talk about salary negotiation confidently.

905
00:44:25,570 --> 00:44:27,330
Use polite language.

906
00:44:27,330 --> 00:44:29,650
Be clear about your expectations.

907
00:44:29,650 --> 00:44:31,490
Always give reasons.

908
00:44:31,490 --> 00:44:33,330
And be open to discussion.

909
00:44:33,330 --> 00:44:36,210
The most important thing is confidence.

910
00:44:36,210 --> 00:44:38,530
You deserve to be paid fairly.

911
00:44:38,530 --> 00:44:40,050
Now it's your turn.

912
00:44:40,050 --> 00:44:42,930
What would you say in a salary negotiation?

913
00:44:42,930 --> 00:44:44,690
Practice these phrases.

914
00:44:44,690 --> 00:44:46,610
Try role-playing with a friend.

915
00:44:46,610 --> 00:44:48,690
Thank you so much for watching.

916
00:44:48,690 --> 00:44:50,690
Keep practicing and improving.

917
00:44:50,690 --> 00:44:52,690
We'll see you in the next lesson.

918
00:44:52,690 --> 00:44:53,490
Take care.

919
00:44:53,490 --> 00:44:53,970
Goodbye.

920
00:44:57,060 --> 00:44:58,180
Hello everyone.

921
00:44:58,180 --> 00:45:00,900
We're really happy to have you with us today.

922
00:45:00,900 --> 00:45:01,860
Hi everyone.

923
00:45:01,860 --> 00:45:03,220
Thanks for joining us.

924
00:45:03,220 --> 00:45:06,500
If you're here to improve your English for real business situations,

925
00:45:06,500 --> 00:45:08,820
you're absolutely in the right place.

926
00:45:08,820 --> 00:45:10,100
I'm Olivia.

927
00:45:10,100 --> 00:45:11,300
And I'm James.

928
